WEBVTT

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:18.040
Oh come on, Himawari!

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.410
We just cleaned this place up last week!

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:25.080
Jeez, how did you make such a mess already?

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:29.630
Hey, I'm still reading that.

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:32.720
Then don't just leave it on the floor!

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:36.100
That's too troublesome.

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:40.850
What are you doing?

00:00:41.940 --> 00:00:47.610
This is Mechanotech's new pilot plant for synthetic polymerase.

00:00:47.860 --> 00:00:50.070
It's so cool!

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:54.530
I wanna see it in person!

00:00:56.830 --> 00:01:00.500
Let's go there on Sunday then!

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:01.870
Really?

00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:04.580
Yeah! But in return...

00:01:05.830 --> 00:01:07.040
you have to...

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:09.630
wear this today!

00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:12.340
What?

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:14.430
Put it on!

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:05.040
Look at that girl! Isn't she cute?

00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:07.540
Yeah! So cute!

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:09.050
She looks like a doll!

00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:11.010
She's so pretty!

00:03:11.010 --> 00:03:12.590
Must be a model.

00:03:14.090 --> 00:03:18.180
See, Himawari? Everyone's looking at you!

00:03:18.970 --> 00:03:20.640
It's embarrassing...

00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:21.930
I wanna go home.

00:03:22.190 --> 00:03:24.190
Why would it be embarrassing?

00:03:24.190 --> 00:03:27.480
They're praising how cute you are!

00:03:27.480 --> 00:03:30.190
Hey, you! Are you shopping?

00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:33.360
If you're free, do you wanna—

00:03:36.620 --> 00:03:38.830
Let's go, Himawari.

00:03:39.950 --> 00:03:41.410
Hey baby, where are you go—

00:03:43.170 --> 00:03:44.790
Hey, haven't we met somewhere befo—

00:03:46.710 --> 00:03:49.300
Jeez, all men are the same!

00:03:51.300 --> 00:03:52.680
Hey, Wakaba...

00:03:53.090 --> 00:03:53.840
Hm?

00:03:53.840 --> 00:03:56.010
The name of this mall...

00:03:56.680 --> 00:03:59.890
La Mer et Le Ciel du F...

00:03:59.890 --> 00:04:02.940
I know part of it's about the sea and the sky, but what about the "F"?

00:04:03.560 --> 00:04:05.940
Ah, it stands for Futaba.

00:04:05.940 --> 00:04:07.940
Futaba? You mean...

00:04:07.940 --> 00:04:12.530
Yeah. Aoi's dad owns this mall.

00:04:12.530 --> 00:04:14.410
Huh? For real?

00:04:14.410 --> 00:04:15.530
Yep.

00:04:16.990 --> 00:04:20.290
Why would the owner's daughter be doing stuff like that then?

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:26.170
Hey, Ms. Engine! Give me a balloon!

00:04:26.170 --> 00:04:27.960
There's one for everyone!

00:04:28.340 --> 00:04:29.880
Here's yours!

00:04:29.880 --> 00:04:32.680
A-Aoi? And Akane?

00:04:32.970 --> 00:04:37.890
Hey! Wakaba! Himawari! Yo!

00:04:37.890 --> 00:04:39.600
Over here!

00:04:43.060 --> 00:04:45.690
Why were you dressed like that, Aoi?

00:04:45.980 --> 00:04:51.490
Akane's working here part-time, even though she just got dismissed from the hospital.

00:04:51.490 --> 00:04:53.360
Are you nuts, Akane?

00:04:55.660 --> 00:04:58.580
I told her I'd be fine by myself...

00:04:58.910 --> 00:05:03.210
You'd say that even if you broke every bone in your body...

00:05:03.210 --> 00:05:05.710
But then I'd be like a jellyfish!

00:05:05.710 --> 00:05:06.960
Akane!

00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:08.630
Sorry...

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:13.730
It's like you're her mother, Aoi!

00:05:14.840 --> 00:05:19.060
In that case, you're Himawari's bodyguard!

00:05:20.220 --> 00:05:23.480
Wh-What makes you say that?

00:05:24.770 --> 00:05:28.070
Because you're trained in the secret arts of the Natural Harmony School!

00:05:28.610 --> 00:05:31.860
Stop making fun of me!

00:05:35.570 --> 00:05:38.580
<i>Why'd Aoi say I'm like a bodyguard?</i>

00:05:42.120 --> 00:05:45.170
Hey, Himawari, are there any shops you wanna check out?

00:05:46.670 --> 00:05:47.800
Not really...

00:05:48.210 --> 00:05:51.550
They don't sell what I'm looking for here.

00:05:52.170 --> 00:05:54.050
What are you looking for?

00:05:54.050 --> 00:05:59.430
I'm interested in the the UDF's supercomputer.

00:05:59.430 --> 00:06:03.600
They're auctioning an old one from two generations ago!

00:06:06.230 --> 00:06:09.030
I have no idea what that is, but it sounds expensive.

00:06:09.030 --> 00:06:14.990
Don't worry! I've got some cash from an app I made a while back, so it'll probably work out!

00:06:16.910 --> 00:06:17.830
Excuse me!

00:06:18.990 --> 00:06:20.500
Do you have a moment?

00:06:21.750 --> 00:06:25.580
We work for this magazine.

00:06:29.380 --> 00:06:30.880
The Girls Morley?!

00:06:30.880 --> 00:06:34.180
I love your magazine!

00:06:34.720 --> 00:06:37.010
Are you from Fairy Street?!

00:06:37.260 --> 00:06:38.510
Bingo!

00:06:38.930 --> 00:06:40.310
What's that?

00:06:40.310 --> 00:06:42.600
It's a column which showcases only the top models!

00:06:42.600 --> 00:06:44.770
Wait, does that mean—

00:06:45.060 --> 00:06:49.280
Indeed. Would you allow us take some pictures of you?

00:06:49.530 --> 00:06:51.780
Pictures? Why?

00:06:52.150 --> 00:06:55.280
It's because you're the cutest girl we've seen all day.

00:06:56.530 --> 00:06:58.370
I'm not really interest—

00:06:58.370 --> 00:07:00.080
We'll accept your offer!

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:02.040
W-Wait a second!

00:07:02.410 --> 00:07:05.340
Isn't this great, Himawari? It's your model debut!

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:07.590
Sure...

00:07:24.690 --> 00:07:28.270
She should smile more.

00:07:28.270 --> 00:07:30.320
Not necessarily.

00:07:32.900 --> 00:07:35.870
Her demeanor creates a certain atmosphere.

00:07:36.120 --> 00:07:38.620
An atmosphere?

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:42.370
She has so much potential!

00:07:43.420 --> 00:07:44.880
Potential?

00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:51.130
The shoot went really well. Thank you very much.

00:07:51.550 --> 00:07:53.300
It was our pleasure.

00:07:53.300 --> 00:07:56.100
Be sure to check it out when it's published!

00:07:56.600 --> 00:07:58.310
Thank you!

00:07:59.720 --> 00:08:01.020
I'm tired.

00:08:06.690 --> 00:08:08.610
Isn't that great, Himawari?

00:08:09.030 --> 00:08:10.650
You're a model now!

00:08:10.650 --> 00:08:13.110
That's awesome! You're so cool!

00:08:13.660 --> 00:08:15.740
I don't care.

00:08:15.740 --> 00:08:18.370
But your pictures are gonna published, right?

00:08:18.870 --> 00:08:20.660
I'm sure people will talk about you!

00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:22.500
I'd rather they not.

00:08:29.710 --> 00:08:31.300
Morning, Wakaba!

00:08:31.300 --> 00:08:33.380
Morning!

00:08:36.970 --> 00:08:38.100
Himawari!

00:08:38.100 --> 00:08:39.600
Hey, Wakaba!

00:08:40.020 --> 00:08:42.480
I made this for the factory tour we talked abo—

00:08:42.480 --> 00:08:44.850
I got word from the magazine!

00:08:46.610 --> 00:08:49.360
The editors loved your pictures,

00:08:49.360 --> 00:08:54.610
so they want to do a proper shoot with make-up artists, stylists, and everything!

00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:02.750
What do you mean by proper shoot?

00:09:03.290 --> 00:09:06.500
I gave the reporter my e-mail address yesterday,

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:09.170
and she emailed me this morning!

00:09:10.210 --> 00:09:11.510
But I...

00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:15.510
Does that mean you're gonna be a professional model?

00:09:15.510 --> 00:09:16.640
That's great!

00:09:16.640 --> 00:09:19.180
Pro? You're gonna go pro, Himawari!

00:09:19.770 --> 00:09:23.770
They want us to do the shoot next Sunday, so don't make any other plans!

00:09:25.940 --> 00:09:27.440
Sunday?

00:09:30.690 --> 00:09:31.780
Stupid Wakaba!

00:09:37.700 --> 00:09:38.950
Himawari?

00:09:38.950 --> 00:09:40.450
What's wrong with her?

00:09:42.750 --> 00:09:43.790
Hey, this!

00:09:44.880 --> 00:09:46.790
Factory tour?

00:09:49.050 --> 00:09:51.300
<i>Oh no! That's on Sunday!</i>

00:09:51.300 --> 00:09:53.470
Huh? Wakaba?

00:10:05.730 --> 00:10:10.070
She promised we'd go to the factory together on Sunday!

00:10:10.440 --> 00:10:11.820
Stupid Wakaba!

00:10:19.410 --> 00:10:21.540
I'm so sorry, Himawari!

00:10:21.960 --> 00:10:23.540
This...

00:10:24.670 --> 00:10:25.790
It doesn't matter.

00:10:28.340 --> 00:10:33.300
I was just happy that everyone was praising you.

00:10:33.720 --> 00:10:36.350
I got carried away...

00:10:36.890 --> 00:10:38.010
I'm sorry!

00:10:38.600 --> 00:10:41.020
I'll tell them we can't go to the shoot on Sunday.

00:10:42.640 --> 00:10:43.560
I'll go.

00:10:45.190 --> 00:10:46.860
I'll go to the shoot.

00:10:46.860 --> 00:10:49.070
You'd get in trouble otherwise,, right?

00:10:50.820 --> 00:10:52.070
Himawari...

00:10:52.570 --> 00:10:55.570
But in return...

00:10:58.280 --> 00:10:59.240
What?

00:11:05.290 --> 00:11:07.090
Look over here!

00:11:12.760 --> 00:11:14.340
Okay, we're done!

00:11:17.930 --> 00:11:22.140
Wakaba, put on my socks!

00:11:22.140 --> 00:11:23.560
Yes, right away!

00:11:25.730 --> 00:11:27.440
Next, my left.

00:11:27.440 --> 00:11:29.860
And my shoes when you're done with that.

00:11:31.440 --> 00:11:32.360
Wakaba!

00:11:32.650 --> 00:11:33.740
Yes, milady?

00:11:33.740 --> 00:11:35.820
The sun's too bright!

00:11:35.820 --> 00:11:37.280
Please leave it to me!

00:11:39.910 --> 00:11:41.790
I'm thirsty.

00:11:41.790 --> 00:11:42.210
On it.

00:11:44.620 --> 00:11:46.130
An apple!

00:11:46.130 --> 00:11:47.090
Here!

00:11:47.090 --> 00:11:49.000
Slice it into rabbits!

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:49.710
Roger!

00:11:57.930 --> 00:11:58.970
So good!

00:12:02.560 --> 00:12:07.190
Please don't worry about it! Today I'm Himawari's servant!

00:12:09.610 --> 00:12:11.450
Wakaba,

00:12:12.200 --> 00:12:13.450
I wanna play a video game!

00:12:13.780 --> 00:12:19.080
A game? I think I have one in my bag...

00:12:19.620 --> 00:12:21.040
Please wait a moment!

00:12:41.640 --> 00:12:43.020
Himawari?

00:12:43.480 --> 00:12:45.480
Oh, she fell asleep?

00:12:47.480 --> 00:12:50.030
Those hairpins won't match with her next dress.

00:12:50.690 --> 00:12:52.700
Could you change them?

00:12:52.700 --> 00:12:53.780
No problem.

00:13:08.500 --> 00:13:09.800
Sorry for the wait!

00:13:12.880 --> 00:13:15.180
I brought you a game!

00:13:18.970 --> 00:13:22.350
Let's return to the van until the weather clears up!

00:13:22.710 --> 00:13:23.890
Roger!

00:13:24.270 --> 00:13:27.020
Hear that? Let's go, Wakaba.

00:13:28.860 --> 00:13:29.610
Yeah...

00:13:34.820 --> 00:13:36.990
Wakaba! Umbrella, please!

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:39.990
Sorry, wait a moment!

00:13:47.960 --> 00:13:49.750
Last shot! Look over here!

00:13:52.220 --> 00:13:54.720
Okay, thank you, Himawari!

00:13:54.720 --> 00:13:56.850
Good work, everyone!

00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:59.010
Good work, Himawari!

00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:03.980
I'm exhausted...

00:14:04.600 --> 00:14:06.490
You worked hard, Himawari.

00:14:08.400 --> 00:14:09.010
Wakaba!

00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:11.900
I wanna drink parsley squash.

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:15.700
Huh? I thought they only sold that at Oshima.

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:17.320
They sell it here too.

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:20.450
I saw some earlier in the food court downstairs.

00:14:20.450 --> 00:14:23.040
I'll forgive you if you get me some!

00:14:23.410 --> 00:14:25.330
Huh? Really?

00:14:27.390 --> 00:14:28.730
Never mind!

00:14:29.630 --> 00:14:30.360
I'll be right back!

00:14:33.130 --> 00:14:34.300
Himawari!

00:14:35.220 --> 00:14:37.430
You were really cute today.

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:40.100
I'm sure the photos will turn out wonderful.

00:14:41.390 --> 00:14:42.480
I guess...

00:14:46.770 --> 00:14:47.650
Huh?

00:14:48.320 --> 00:14:51.030
Ah, we changed those earlier.

00:14:51.400 --> 00:14:54.660
You were sleeping at the time, so you didn't notice.

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:57.450
Then where are <i>my</i> hairpins?

00:14:58.030 --> 00:15:00.450
I wonder...

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:03.960
Do you guys know where Himawari's hairpins are?

00:15:04.870 --> 00:15:07.210
I put them on table earlier.

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:13.260
I need to find them!

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:33.920
No way.

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:36.450
The tide...

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:37.950
What should I do?

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:42.710
Have you seen some hairpins around here?

00:15:43.120 --> 00:15:45.920
My hairpins. The yellow ones!

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:47.000
I haven't.

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:50.170
They should be somewhere around here...

00:15:50.170 --> 00:15:52.050
They were probably washed away by the tide...

00:15:53.380 --> 00:15:55.800
So what? Are you going to just give up?

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:56.350
No way!

00:15:56.800 --> 00:16:00.220
They're really really important!

00:16:05.600 --> 00:16:06.730
That's right.

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:09.360
You'll never find what you don't look for.

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:11.740
I won't give up either.

00:16:12.360 --> 00:16:13.450
No matter what.

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:16.620
Whatever it takes, I'll get it all back.

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:31.300
What are you doing, Himawari?! It's dangerous!

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:31.840
Let's go back!

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:32.970
Let go of me!

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:34.970
I've gotta find my hairpins!

00:16:35.300 --> 00:16:38.970
They were your gift to me!

00:16:38.970 --> 00:16:41.520
They're here! I've got them!

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:45.060
Look!

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:50.480
I picked them up earlier.

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:03.710
There we go. Done.

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:05.420
Thanks.

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:13.170
You got them for me, so I didn't want to lose them!

00:17:13.170 --> 00:17:15.090
That's why you jumped into the sea?

00:17:15.090 --> 00:17:19.560
I was afraid you'd hate me if I lost them...

00:17:19.560 --> 00:17:23.310
Why would I?! There's no way I would!

00:17:23.310 --> 00:17:24.060
Really?

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:25.560
Of course!

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:28.650
Wakaba...

00:17:30.280 --> 00:17:32.650
By the way, where's Kuroki?

00:17:33.740 --> 00:17:35.360
What about her?

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:38.830
Never mind...

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:46.790
Let's go, Wakaba!

00:17:51.760 --> 00:17:53.010
Ignition!

00:17:56.180 --> 00:17:57.470
Texture...

00:17:58.850 --> 00:17:59.600
On!

00:19:00.750 --> 00:19:03.870
The Alone has left orbit and is entering the atmosphere!

00:19:04.420 --> 00:19:07.380
The calculated crash site is Blue Island!

00:19:08.340 --> 00:19:09.800
Damn Alone!

00:19:09.800 --> 00:19:11.420
This kind of an attack...

00:19:11.420 --> 00:19:13.630
It's willing to sacrifice itself?!

00:19:14.050 --> 00:19:18.640
Isshiki and Futaba will be arriving at the target area soon.

00:19:19.430 --> 00:19:20.720
Operation

00:19:21.480 --> 00:19:23.560
VividBlue!

00:19:54.050 --> 00:19:58.720
<i>Hurry, Akane! You mustn't allow it to crash into the island!</i>

00:19:59.010 --> 00:20:00.350
Okay!

00:20:00.350 --> 00:20:02.980
<i>Aoi! Smash it to pieces!</i>

00:20:02.980 --> 00:20:05.810
<i>Knock it into next week with VividImpact!</i>

00:20:05.810 --> 00:20:06.650
<i>Okay!</i>

00:20:27.880 --> 00:20:30.710
Gramps, we can't close in on it like this!

00:20:31.630 --> 00:20:34.220
VividBlue is under heavy fire!

00:20:35.550 --> 00:20:38.310
Where are the other two?!

00:20:38.310 --> 00:20:39.760
<i>Reporting in!</i>

00:20:40.680 --> 00:20:41.980
<i>Sorry for the wait!</i>

00:20:42.810 --> 00:20:44.850
Wakaba! Himawari!

00:20:47.270 --> 00:20:49.690
Naked Collider!

00:20:55.700 --> 00:20:58.740
Naked Blade!

00:21:02.080 --> 00:21:04.420
Go now, VividBlue!

00:21:06.580 --> 00:21:08.750
<i>Release final safety!</i>

00:21:16.260 --> 00:21:19.850
Final Operation!

00:21:34.070 --> 00:21:35.950
<i>You were late.</i>

00:21:36.910 --> 00:21:39.450
<i>You were not ready. It is your own fault.</i>

00:21:47.920 --> 00:21:52.880
Um... Can we really see all of this in a day?

00:21:53.130 --> 00:21:54.050
Of course!

00:21:54.050 --> 00:21:55.890
Also...

00:21:55.890 --> 00:21:56.590
Look!

00:21:56.590 --> 00:21:58.010
What's that?

00:21:59.970 --> 00:22:03.020
Our factory visiting schedule for the rest of the year!

00:22:03.390 --> 00:22:05.350
Rest of the... year?

00:22:05.650 --> 00:22:09.230
Yeah! And you're coming with me!

00:22:14.110 --> 00:22:17.200
<i>My Sundays!</i>

00:22:29.550 --> 00:22:32.090
I'll get it all back, no matter what!

00:22:33.300 --> 00:22:35.090
The world I belong to!

00:24:14.660 --> 00:24:16.320
According to this phenomenon that has been proven to work,

00:24:16.710 --> 00:24:21.000
it's become possible to strengthen the Alone.

00:24:21.000 --> 00:24:27.000
Therefore, the next episode title can be deduced to be: Light And Shadow.
